in any statewide race in Tennessee. Bradshaw is the Democratic nominee in the 2026 United States Senate election in Tennessee.","extract_html":"<p><b>Marquita Bradshaw</b> is an American environmentalist, activist, and political candidate. She was the Democratic nominee in the 2020 United States Senate election in Tennessee, the first African American woman to win a major political party nomination in any statewide race in Tennessee. Bradshaw is the Democratic nominee in the 2026 United States Senate election in Tennessee.</p>"}